description "Insert the ReactOS install ISO and start the machine"
platform    winnt
machine     stopped
timeout     30s

# This script only inserts the ISO and boots — it doesn't drive the
# rest of setup with `wait` statements, on purpose.
#
# Reliquary reads text off a screen by recognizing each character's
# shape against a library of known fonts. ReactOS's text-mode setup
# draws its own custom font, which isn't in that library, so
# reliquary can't read this screen's text correctly (this is a real
# limitation, not a bug in this script — see D109).
#
# Whoever drives the rest of the install has to work from raw screen
# pixels instead of recognized text (the same way `click` finds
# things on screen). See test_reactos_click_integration.py for how.
insert cdrom0 @reactos-iso
start
